title: Psalms 6–8: How Long, O Lord? and the Excellent Name
description: Psalms 6-8 in the King James Bible: persistent prayer and the Lord's chastening, God judgeth the righteous and is angry with the wicked every day, and the excellent name of the Lord, Jesus, from the Psalms series studies.
